Text: On the other hand, the retrieved table could be used as the input for question answering (Pasupat and Liang, 2015). Unlike existing studies in database community (Cafarella et al., 2008; Balakrishnan et al., 2015) that utilize surrounding text of a table or pager- ank score of a web page, we focus on making a thorough exploration of table content in this work. We believe that content-based table retrieval has the following challenges.

