=== Generated Answer (model draft; check against evidence) ===
The paper uses negative log-likelihood as the loss function for training the neural network parameters with back-propagation [1]. The paper also notes that a ranking-based loss function, max(0, 1−fnn(ta, q)+fnn(t\*a, q)), was implemented but performed worse than the negative log-likelihood in their experiment [10].
